					Att. 1, 16, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lex,</span>”
				<i>relating to dice-playing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Mil. 2, 2, 9</span></i>
			 (dub.; Ritschl, alearia).</div>
